<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter reports higher 1997 Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Rieter reports higher 1997 Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rieter Holding AG said its profit and turnover during the 1997 first quarter were higher as compared to the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Our turnover and profit is better as compared to the previous year,&quot; chief executive Kurt Feller said at the group's annual news conference. He did not provide any details. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
